{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/56699-storytellers-the-kaaba","id":56699,"title":"Storytellers: the Kaaba?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-01-24T06:26:24-08:00","id":56699,"title":"Storytellers: the Kaaba?","content":"Ever since i came upon the Kaaba during research for the CWoD Mummy game, I've always wondered if it has a place in Mummy mythos. For some reason, when the book spoke of the Shan'Iatu uncovering the great black stone in the Sahara, I got three images immediately: a) the obelisk in Space Odyssey, b) a meteorite, and c) the Kaaba. What do you guys think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-24T14:26:02-08:00","id":57004,"title":"","content":"You may be on to something.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-01-25T23:55:50-08:00","id":57947,"title":"","content":"Has anyone played around with theories of the black stone found in the desert?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-08T01:07:35-08:00","id":67778,"title":"","content":"Its a touchy subject, but no worse then someone putting a Relic in the Vatican Library (&quot;Oh god...YOU KILLED TOM HANKS!&quot;) or something similar. It wouldn't be hard for an Imam to mistake a fantastic object of Irem for a holy item. Hell, it technically IS a holy item, just not something Allah had anything to do with. That said, if you DO run something like this, it's best done carefully. The Kabaa is one of the most sacred objects in Islam, and its not to be taken lightly (I'm not a Muslim, by the way. And I'd be doing this with any other faith that popped up on here.)<br /> <br /> If you want to take it further, you could claim Tunguska was a Mummy waking up, and while still at Sekhem 10, nuking the area with a powerful Utterance (Although I think a Quashmalilim was responsible for that in canon. I've always liked the idea that it WAS a Meteor...that promptly crashed into a True Fae hunting down some Russian Changelings!). Or claiming that some of the Judges of Duat later inspired the Ars Goetia and the Keys of Solomon (Maybe similar rites where used by the Priests...And the existing ones might just be a little TOO similar...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1645-autochthon","name":"Autochthon","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"70"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-10T08:11:08-08:00","id":69085,"title":"","content":"I certainly wouldn't treat the Kaaba lightly. If anything, I'm sort of wondering if it is not the Amulet of the Two Fingers (which i tie to the black stone, as well as the ladder/gateway to heaven). In game, it'd be a sacred, preiremite relic of great power that may or may not lead you to Heaven and face whatever God(s) is really up there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T04:15:29-08:00","id":69746,"title":"","content":"Great minds do think alike.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#000080\">Matthew Dawkins</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000080\">In-House Developer for Onyx Path Publishing</span></b><br /> <br /> <i><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><b><span style=\"color:#008080\">Website: </span><a href=\"http://www.matthewdawkins.com\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.matthewdawkins.com</span></a><br /> <span style=\"color:#008080\">Patreon: </span><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008080\">https://www.patreon.com/matthewdawkins</span></a></b></span></i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/152-the-gentleman-gamer","name":"The Gentleman Gamer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar152_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1698"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-11T13:47:09-08:00","id":70016,"title":"","content":"It's an issue of diverse opinions amongst the Arisen - with one or two claiming to have called down the original meteor, while others think it's a powerful Relic, etc. None have gotten close since the last Sophic Turn as it is now actively guarded by Muslim Hunters who are well aware of the False Gods and their Jahiliyahh Cults that once ruled the region.<br /> <br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">If I gave a PC access to it, rather than something that could serve the interests of the Judges, I'd let it be a key toward Apotheosis </div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T12:11:43-08:00","id":70767,"title":"","content":"Spoiler tags shouldn't be necessary, I tagged it for storytellers. But it sounds like we all agree that the Kaaba could have ties to Apotheiosis. And i agree that Muslim Hunters wouldn't let any Mummies nearby, nor likely any monster but islamic magi whove aligned themselves with the hunters. Whether or not it is the Kaaba, I think that the black stone that the Shan'iatu found in the desert is the Amulet of Two Fingers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/935-cleverest-of-things","name":"Cleverest of Things","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar935_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"650"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}